1000 #edb/ref 17592186388570 13194139536199 true] [17592186388565 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536199 true] [17592186388565 1041 "selection" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388565 1104 #edb/ref 17592186388566 13194139536199 true] [17592186388565 1110 #uuid "c3957011-6333-58ef-b929-20d4ad2bfacb" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388566 1034 "⟨3,-2,-10⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388566 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388566 1111 #uuid "98700330-3eeb-585a-9203-09b9d81b7eec" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388567 1034 "⟨2,2,-10⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388567 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388567 1111 #uuid "e0ebb07e-8e9e-59a2-a0e3-ff47873117ed" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388568 1034 "⟨-3,3,10⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388568 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388568 1111 #uuid "d8514cc6-e956-570e-8f44-ecbf1cc2b777" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388569 1034 "⟨-2,3,10⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388569 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388569 1111 #uuid "441a94a3-44b2-5c48-8c6e-0343e4de510b" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388570 1034 "⟨2,3,-10⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388570 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388570 1111 #uuid "6615e915-8179-5315-922e-37a674edda05" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388571 1017 #edb/ref 17592186388572 13194139536199 true] [17592186388571 1089 "q-129171" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388571 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536199 true] [17592186388571 1100 "Find a direction vector of the line that is given as the intersection of the following two planes:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}5x-2z+13=0 \\\\ 2y-3z-25=0\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388571 1113 #uuid "85fcd4d1-25d1-559e-b810-7404c2aacc48" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388571 1145 "First, we notice:\n\n- For the plane $5x-2z+13=0,$ a normal vector to the plane is ${n}_{1}=⟨5,0,-2⟩.$\n\n- For the plane $2y-3z-25=0,$ a normal vector to the plane is ${n}_{2}=⟨0,2,-3⟩.$\n\nTo find a direction vector for the line, we calculate the cross product of these normal vectors:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & ={n}_{1}\\times {n}_{2} \\\\  & =⟨5,0,-2⟩\\times ⟨0,2,-3⟩ \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 5 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -3\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =4i+15j+10k \\\\  & =⟨4,15,10⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388572 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388573 13194139536199 true] [17592186388572 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388574 13194139536199 true] [17592186388572 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388575 13194139536199 true] [17592186388572 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388576 13194139536199 true] [17592186388572 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388577 13194139536199 true] [17592186388572 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536199 true] [17592186388572 1041 "selection" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388572 1104 #edb/ref 17592186388574 13194139536199 true] [17592186388572 1110 #uuid "f5d7480c-337b-5f49-b755-cc8e97dbac56" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388573 1034 "⟨4,0,10⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388573 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388573 1111 #uuid "4c29b290-a959-518e-a935-e2a5adfd783c" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388574 1034 "⟨4,15,10⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388574 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388574 1111 #uuid "ea7b81ed-fe49-5012-a746-8fdb81c47ed8" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388575 1034 "⟨15,4,10⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388575 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388575 1111 #uuid "7d391d1d-691a-5e30-b1d2-9fc99666d1cb" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388576 1034 "⟨0,6,4⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388576 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388576 1111 #uuid "eb1c5069-f046-5309-89ea-44e56594cba5" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388577 1034 "⟨14,11,10⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388577 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388577 1111 #uuid "1e236c63-96bd-5392-ac50-c396ac069c08" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388578 1017 #edb/ref 17592186388579 13194139536199 true] [17592186388578 1089 "q-129174" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388578 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536199 true] [17592186388578 1100 "Find a direction vector of the line that is given as the intersection of the planes $2x=6$ and $z=1-y.$" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388578 1113 #uuid "c61ebc2f-8bbc-5c89-bcf3-6676fa54cd9f" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388578 1145 "First, notice that: \n\n- For the plane $2x=6$, a normal vector to the plane is ${n}_{1}=⟨2,0,0⟩.$\n\n- For the plane $z=1-y$ (or $y+z=1$), a normal vector to the plane is ${n}_{2}=⟨0,1,1⟩.$\n\nTo find a direction vector for the line, we calculate the cross product of these normal vectors:  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & ={n}_{1}\\times {n}_{2} \\\\  & =⟨2,0,0⟩\\times ⟨0,1,1⟩ \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =-2j+2k \\\\  & =⟨0,-2,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388579 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388580 13194139536199 true] [17592186388579 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388581 13194139536199 true] [17592186388579 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388582 13194139536199 true] [17592186388579 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388583 13194139536199 true] [17592186388579 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388584 13194139536199 true] [17592186388579 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536199 true] [17592186388579 1041 "selection" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388579 1104 #edb/ref 17592186388582 13194139536199 true] [17592186388579 1110 #uuid "90eb342c-9408-5539-a9e2-bbb96bd2c38d" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388580 1034 "⟨2,-2,1⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388580 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388580 1111 #uuid "6aa606c2-8f2f-5b98-a400-94496b674cc7" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388581 1034 "⟨-2,1,2⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388581 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388581 1111 #uuid "8d727482-e328-5e27-9509-1c4960039de1" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388582 1034 "⟨0,-2,2⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388582 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388582 1111 #uuid "1f8173bc-fe42-5904-8df7-f78bca46ebc6" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388583 1034 "⟨-2,2,0⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388583 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388583 1111 #uuid "6b74c54b-4ee2-55ae-bb61-e9f201dea629" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388584 1034 "⟨1,-2,2⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388584 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388584 1111 #uuid "2c096c0e-c190-5f6b-8899-78d8a134d8b7" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388585 1017 #edb/ref 17592186388586 13194139536199 true] [17592186388585 1089 "q-129175" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388585 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536199 true] [17592186388585 1100 "The intersection of the planes $2x-y-6=0$ and $y+z+6=0$ is given by the line\n\n$$\nr(t)=⟨{a}_{1},0,{a}_{3}⟩+tb,\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$\n\nCalculate ${a}_{1}+{a}_{3},$ and find a possible direction vector $b.$" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388585 1113 #uuid "8ab147de-05e3-575b-9736-166ad337abc3" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388585 1145 "We're given that there exists a point on the line where $y=0.$ Substituting this to the first equation gives\n\n$$\n2x-0-6=0\\,⟹\\,x=3,\n$$\n\nand substituting $y=0$ into the second equation gives\n\n$$\n0+z+6=0\\,⟹\\,z=-6.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=⟨3,0,-6⟩$ is a position vector of a point on the line.\n\nNext, we notice:\n\n- For the plane $2x-y-6=0,$ a normal vector to the plane is ${n}_{1}=⟨2,-1,0⟩.$\n\n- For the plane $y+z+6=0,$ a normal vector to the plane is ${n}_{2}=⟨0,1,1⟩.$\n\nTo find a direction vector for the line, we calculate the cross product of these normal vectors:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b & ={n}_{1}\\times {n}_{2} \\\\  & =⟨2,-1,0⟩\\times ⟨0,1,1⟩ \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =-i-2j+2k \\\\  & =⟨-1,-2,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe equation of the line is:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(t) & =a+tb \\\\ r(t) & =⟨3,0,-6⟩+t⟨-1,-2,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally then, ${a}_{1}+{a}_{3}=3-6=-3,$ and $b=⟨-1,-2,2⟩.$" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388586 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388587 13194139536199 true] [17592186388586 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388588 13194139536199 true] [17592186388586 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388589 13194139536199 true] [17592186388586 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388590 13194139536199 true] [17592186388586 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388591 13194139536199 true] [17592186388586 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536199 true] [17592186388586 1041 "selection" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388586 1104 #edb/ref 17592186388590 13194139536199 true] [17592186388586 1110 #uuid "c049a225-10f3-5691-ab8f-07354ee48ff3" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388587 1034 "{a}_{1}+{a}_{3}=-6,\\,b=⟨-2,1,2⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388587 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388587 1111 #uuid "5ad1c351-8b33-5d91-a19c-839b8f93b72a" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388588 1034 "{a}_{1}+{a}_{3}=6,\\,b=⟨-2,2,1⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388588 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388588 1111 #uuid "dd366cf3-fab8-5d0f-85e1-0e620a8ac49e" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388589 1034 "{a}_{1}+{a}_{3}=-9,\\,b=⟨2,-2,2⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388589 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388589 1111 #uuid "03fd85c5-04f3-5b3c-9bee-16cfefcd9514" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388590 1034 "{a}_{1}+{a}_{3}=-3,\\,b=⟨-1,-2,2⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388590 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388590 1111 #uuid "f55f11b7-a375-59e4-911f-8491fbf63110" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388591 1034 "{a}_{1}+{a}_{3}=3,\\,b=⟨-1,2,-2⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388591 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388591 1111 #uuid "e7f37ed3-8b77-55d0-8ce2-ddaf10e71430" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388592 1017 #edb/ref 17592186388593 13194139536199 true] [17592186388592 1089 "q-129240" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388592 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536199 true] [17592186388592 1100 "Given the two planes $3x-y+2z=0$ and $9x-3y+6z+5=0$, which of the following statements are true?\n\n- The normal vectors of the planes are parallel.\n- The planes are parallel but not coincident.\n- The planes are coincident." 13194139536199 true] [17592186388592 1113 #uuid "ec4b7b58-5e99-5775-a247-d485bccefd9a" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388592 1145 "First, notice that:\n\n- For the plane $3x-y+2z=0,$ a normal vector to the plane is ${n}_{1}=⟨3,-1,2⟩.$\n\n- For the plane $9x-3y+6z+5=0,$ a normal vector to the plane is ${n}_{2}=⟨9,-3,6⟩.$\n\nNow, let's consider the statements.\n\n- Statement I is true. Indeed, ${n}_{2}=3{n}_{1}.$ So, the normal vectors are parallel.\n\n- Statement II is true, while statement III is false. \n\nFor the two planes to coincide, the equation of one plane should be a scalar multiple of the other. However, if we try to manipulate the equation of the second plane to resemble the equation of the first plane, we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9x-3y+6z+5=0 \\\\ 3x-y+2z+\\frac{5}{3}=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nClearly, this equation is not the same as the equation of the first plane. So, the planes are parallel but not coincident.\n\nTherefore, only statements I and II are true." 13194139536199 true] [17592186388593 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388594 13194139536199 true] [17592186388593 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388595 13194139536199 true] [17592186388593 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388596 13194139536199 true] [17592186388593 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388597 13194139536199 true] [17592186388593 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388598 13194139536199 true] [17592186388593 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536199 true] [17592186388593 1041 "selection" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388593 1104 #edb/ref 17592186388597 13194139536199 true] [17592186388593 1110 #uuid "5997ec00-78cd-53e3-b6c1-d68d75c28537" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388594 1034 "II and III only" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388594 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536199 true] [17592186388594 1111 #uuid "3e16dced-6a5b-5620-be58-2deed5be94f7" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388595 1034 "I and III only" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388595 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536199 true] [17592186388595 1111 #uuid "d7885c75-9a6b-558b-815a-f3d7f8911130" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388596 1034 "III only" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388596 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536199 true] [17592186388596 1111 #uuid "ed16028f-62c9-50d5-9e6a-84ba0c43acf0" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388597 1034 "I and II only" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388597 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536199 true] [17592186388597 1111 #uuid "bff585ed-0087-519d-b065-55be030055fd" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388598 1034 "II only" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388598 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536199 true] [17592186388598 1111 #uuid "fba97427-7bd6-5b14-a709-fcfc4f4312a3" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388599 1017 #edb/ref 17592186388600 13194139536199 true] [17592186388599 1089 "q-71250" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388599 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536199 true] [17592186388599 1100 "Find a direction vector of the line that is given as the intersection of the following two planes:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}-x+z-3=0 \\\\ 3x+2y-5=0\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388599 1113 #uuid "a2b8a634-f438-5018-bd9b-7ab535d7a931" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388599 1145 "First, we notice:\n\n- For the plane $-x+z-3=0,$ a normal vector to the plane is ${n}_{1}=⟨-1,0,1⟩.$\n\n- For the plane $3x+2y-5=0,$ a normal vector to the plane is ${n}_{2}=⟨3,2,0⟩.$\n\nTo find a direction vector for the line, we calculate the cross product of these normal vectors:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & ={n}_{1}\\times {n}_{2} \\\\  & =⟨-1,0,1⟩\\times ⟨3,2,0⟩ \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =-2i+3j-2k \\\\  & =⟨-2,3,-2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388600 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388601 13194139536199 true] [17592186388600 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388602 13194139536199 true] [17592186388600 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388603 13194139536199 true] [17592186388600 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388604 13194139536199 true] [17592186388600 1000 #edb/ref 17592186388605 13194139536199 true] [17592186388600 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536199 true] [17592186388600 1041 "selection" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388600 1104 #edb/ref 17592186388604 13194139536199 true] [17592186388600 1110 #uuid "86e9dc10-4419-568e-b48f-c804abae583a" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388601 1034 "⟨3,2,0⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388601 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388601 1111 #uuid "3d480cf1-d8da-52d8-acad-12613d2abecb" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388602 1034 "⟨-1,1,-3⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388602 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388602 1111 #uuid "f346f7d9-30ff-5b4b-8f11-4c0d3f6de38f" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388603 1034 "⟨3,2,-5⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388603 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388603 1111 #uuid "d3305f30-d7c9-5c02-bade-e779c12955d4" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388604 1034 "⟨-2,3,-2⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388604 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388604 1111 #uuid "bb462a2a-a8ea-5c52-87e2-5ce0a4b58c30" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388605 1034 "⟨-1,0,1⟩" 13194139536199 true] [17592186388605 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536199 true] [17592186388605 1111 #uuid "0015dfe6-66b1-5bcb-b770-6499254a0c7e" 13194139536199 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-129168" 17592186388564 "q-129168/selection" 17592186388565 "q-129168/selection/6f4d8dc210419d30777910be2280a229d9f64f485e5c208b3718e8f785ce1868" 17592186388566 "q-129168/selection/875d1b9d8e1b5babc10a30217be979